WEBVTT

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Dev: Welcome to the maintenance check-in. Our summary: Ovens and mixers need regular servicing to avoid lost baking days.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Dev: Each deck oven is serviced every three months.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Ben: The dough mixer at Harbour has a worn belt and is due a repair.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:16.000
Dev: Service contracts renew in March.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:38.000
Ben: Decision: Keep the current service provider for another year.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:56.000
Dev: Action: Order the Harbour mixer belt. Please confirm by Friday.

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:11.000
Dev: Action: Diarise the March service renewals. Please confirm by Friday.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:26.000
Ben: Thanks. Summary sent after the call.
